load @term/seed/structure/ring
  find ring

# A vertex operator algebra: the algebraic axiomatization of a two-dimensional conformal field theory, where states are
# operators that can be inserted at points of a curve and expanded against each other. It is the structure behind the
# monstrous moonshine connecting the largest sporadic group to modular functions. The form carries the underlying ring.
form vertex-operator-algebra
  link ring, like ring
